        "en": "The selected object is the 2013-12-04 twelve-track CD COCP-38334, not the 1978 LP LX-7043. Track 12 is explicitly a bonus track; the original album has eleven tracks. Official 2021 box credits document the original program, but no audio-master equivalence between these editions or the digital links is asserted.",
